{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Tank World</strong>, a turn-based strategic party game where toy tanks clash in a child\u2019s bedroom turned into a miniature battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet tactical gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player commands a squad of toy tanks, planning movements and attacks every turn. Anticipation and precision are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun multiplayer modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local play</strong>: Perfect for friendly matches on the same screen.<br><strong>Online play</strong>: Challenge other players and prove your strategic skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A playful and colorful world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles come to life among toys, blocks, and familiar objects. The lighthearted atmosphere makes the game accessible to all kinds of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a born strategist or just looking for some fun with friends, <strong>Little Tank World</strong> delivers action-packed battles full of energy and good vibes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574640?t=1758649860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574640?t=1758649860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/3d62adf813192fbd71d38ec7b695651b3eaf9ae5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758649860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/3d62adf813192fbd71d38ec7b695651b3eaf9ae5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758649860","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Tank World</strong>, a turn-based strategic party game where toy tanks clash in a child\u2019s bedroom turned into a miniature battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet tactical gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player commands a squad of toy tanks, planning movements and attacks every turn. Anticipation and precision are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun multiplayer modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local play</strong>: Perfect for friendly matches on the same screen.<br><strong>Online play</strong>: Challenge other players and prove your strategic skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A playful and colorful world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles come to life among toys, blocks, and familiar objects. The lighthearted atmosphere makes the game accessible to all kinds of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a born strategist or just looking for some fun with friends, <strong>Little Tank World</strong> delivers action-packed battles full of energy and good vibes!</p>","developers":["Synton Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/665b638164cffe1e5de56e3d5f66e458c214171c/header.jpg?t=1758649860","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Little Tank World","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<